{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"powder_horn","model_identifier":"powder_horn","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## powder_horn\n\nGunpowder gear.\n\n- Cubes: 9 (0 rotated). Texture 32x16, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.6..1.6, y -6.1..0.4, z -6.5..4.8 (size 3.2 x 6.5 x 11.2 u = 9 x 18 x 32 cm).\nPowder horn: a pale cow horn hanging level, wide end back (+Z) closed with a brass cap, tapering and curling forward to a brass spout; slung on a cord from both ends. Origin = cord top at **slot_hip_l** (hip); the horn hangs 3-6 u below, 13 u long.\n"},"description":"## powder_horn\n\nGunpowder gear.\n\n- Cubes: 9 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32 (padded from 32x16; UVs unchanged), 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.6..1.6, y -6.1..0.4, z -6.5..4.8 (size 3.2 x 6.5 x 11.2 u = 9 x 18 x 32 cm).\nPowder horn: a pale cow horn hanging level, wide end back (+Z) closed with a brass cap, tapering and curling forward to a brass spout; slung on a cord from both ends. Origin = cord top at **slot_hip_l** (hip); the horn hangs 3-6 u below, 13 u long.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"cord_back","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.2,-3.0,3.3],"to":[0.2,0.0,3.7],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[25,7,25.4,10.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[26,7,26.4,10.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[27,7,27.4,10.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[28,7,28.4,10.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[8,12,8.4,12.4],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[9,12,9.4,12.4],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"de5a4549-de6d-56ff-9a84-969add604e18"},{"name":"cord_front","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.2,-